<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Johnnic buys stake in Gallagher.</title>
<headline>Johnnic buys stake in Gallagher.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnnies Industrial Corp Ltd has bought 14.9 million shares in Gallagher Estate Holdings Ltd, representing around 34.75 percent of the firm, from Riccia Finance Proprietary Ltd (Ricfin), Gallagher said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Ricfin is a wholly owned subsidiary of Johnnic and Riccia Group Holdings (Pty) Ltd.</p>
<p>No exact price was given in the brief announcement.</p>
</text>
